<title>USA: American Financial Group Inc Q3 rises.</title>
<headline>American Financial Group Inc Q3 rises.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In Millions, Except Per Share Data)</p>
<p>				     Three months ended September 30,</p>
<p>						   1996	1995</p>
<p> Revenues excluding realized gains  $  991.0  $ 979.0</p>
<p> Net Earnings				  113.2     53.0</p>
<p>Earnings per Common Share:</p>
<p>Before realized gains, nonrecurring</p>
<p>     and extraordinary items		 .48	.60</p>
<p>   Net earnings				 1.86	.99</p>
<p> Average number of Common Shares	  61.0     53.4</p>
<p>				     Nine months ended September 30,</p>
<p>						   1996     1995</p>
<p> Revenues excluding realized gains $2,996.4 $2,527.9</p>
<p> Net Earnings				 235.2    116.4</p>
<p>Earnings per Common Share:</p>
<p>Before realized gains, nonrecurring</p>
<p>     and extraordinary items	     2.26     1.74</p>
<p>   Net earnings				3.87     2.45</p>
<p> Average number of Common Shares	 60.7     44.9</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 Q3 includes net realized gains of $172.4 million, or $2.83 per share, primarily from the company's sale of its investment in Citicasters Inc. The gain was reduced by a charge of $80 million, or $1.31 per share, resulting from a decision to increase insurance reserves relating to asbestos and other environmental matters.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk, 212 859-1610</p>
